ithub.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/24940923419","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"f6e44a3fb08f3814a789ba2ac53af609b9c5a403","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/f6e44a3fb08f3814a789ba2ac53af609b9c5a403","created_at":"2026-04-28T09:24:20Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"902fb64b244d7613dd93d5fda072266cbec8dcc8","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDkwMmZiNjRiMjQ0ZDc2MTNkZDkzZDVmZGEwNzIyNjZjYmVjOGRjYzg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/902fb64b244d7613dd93d5fda072266cbec8dcc8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/902fb64b244d7613dd93d5fda072266cbec8dcc8","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T08:52:34Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T09:39:02Z"},"tree":{"sha":"1f036bedf66f8ce50718ebe1d69910c9744348cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/1f036bedf66f8ce50718ebe1d69910c9744348cd"},"message":"integration/tsric: add TailscaleRustInContainer package\n\nAdd TailscaleRustInContainer (tsric), a Rust-client counterpart to\nintegration/tsic. It runs the axum example from tailscale-rs in a\nDocker container and exposes the same lifecycle hooks as tsic\n(Shutdown, SaveLog, Execute, WriteFile) so integration tests can\ntreat it as any other Tailscale node.\n\nDockerfile.tailscale-rs clones tailscale-rs at build time, so no\nlocal source checkout is required. The repo URL and ref are Docker\nbuild arguments (TAILSCALE_RS_REPO, TAILSCALE_RS_REF) exposed as\ntsric.WithRepo / tsric.WithRef options. The HEADSCALE_INTEGRATION_\nTAILSCALE_RS_IMAGE environment variable provides an escape hatch\nfor using a pre-built image instead of building from source.\n\nThe Dockerfile patches the cloned root Cargo.toml to expose\nts_control's insecure-keyfetch feature through the tailscale crate\nso the axum example can fetch the control key over plain HTTP.\nThe integration harness serves the control plane without TLS,\nwhich is the only mode tailscale-rs can register against until it\ngrows a way to inject a custom CA bundle.","parents":[{"sha":"3672a2df3a860bcb97f932d3dc7785406329b49e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3672a2df3a860bcb97f932d3dc7785406329b49e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3672a2df3a860bcb97f932d3dc7785406329b49e"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"f1c0eec899951415893da66819eb11da3d9a537e","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGYxYzBlZWM4OTk5NTE0MTU4OTNkYTY2ODE5ZWIxMWRhM2Q5YTUzN2U","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f1c0eec899951415893da66819eb11da3d9a537e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f1c0eec899951415893da66819eb11da3d9a537e","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T08:52:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T09:39:02Z"},"tree":{"sha":"ab2df6cc635d40d7d8c7b7ca1c4ebfab3e711c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/ab2df6cc635d40d7d8c7b7ca1c4ebfab3e711c90"},"message":"integration: add TestTailscaleRustAxum for tailscale-rs\n\nAdd an integration test that runs the tailscale-rs axum example\nagainst headscale end-to-end. The test provisions one headscale\ninstance, one Go tailscale probe client (tsic), and one\ntailscale-rs node (tsric) on the same tailnet, then verifies:\n\n  - the tailscale-rs node registers and is assigned both an IPv4\n    and an IPv6 address\n  - the Go probe sees the tailscale-rs node as a peer in its status\n  - GET /index.html and GET /assets/index.css from the axum server\n    return the expected content over the tailnet\n  - three sequential POST /count calls return distinct, incrementing\n    counter values, proving netstack state is maintained across\n    multiple TCP connections\n\nThis is the first integration test that exercises a non-Go\nTailscale client against headscale, giving end-to-end coverage of\nthe control protocol for alternate implementations.","parents":[{"sha":"902fb64b244d7613dd93d5fda072266cbec8dcc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/902fb64b244d7613dd93d5fda072266cbec8dcc8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/902fb64b244d7613dd93d5fda072266cbec8dcc8"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"17661da5edd1de4c58caf9f9dd63af6721b40faf","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDE3NjYxZGE1ZWRkMWRlNGM1OGNhZjlmOWRkNjNhZjY3MjFiNDBmYWY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/17661da5edd1de4c58caf9f9dd63af6721b40faf","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/17661da5edd1de4c58caf9f9dd63af6721b40faf","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T08:52:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T09:39:02Z"},"tree":{"sha":"ed5a52fbe5f419556a7fa28b714797183f19ff90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/ed5a52fbe5f419556a7fa28b714797183f19ff90"},"message":"ci: regenerate test-integration.yaml for TestTailscaleRustAxum\n\nPick up the new tailscale-rs integration test in the CI job matrix.","parents":[{"sha":"f1c0eec899951415893da66819eb11da3d9a537e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f1c0eec899951415893da66819eb11da3d9a537e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f1c0eec899951415893da66819eb11da3d9a537e"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":24941439868,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887-2sIwzwAAAAXOoCt8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/24941439868","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"17661da5edd1de4c58caf9f9dd63af6721b40faf","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/